    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '<color=#E69529><b>RACK BUILD ORDER</b></color>


    GROUND FLOOR / RACK01

    Top
    to bottom: PDU1, Patch1, AN-1, CN-1, IT2 (server).


    SECOND FLOOR / RACK02

    Top
    to bottom: PDU2, Patch2, AN-2.


    WORK AREAS

    IT1: IT room | Reception1
    and Reception2: Reception

    Data1: Office 1 | Data2 and Data3: Office 2

    AP-1
    and TestLaptop: Guest Lounge. Use these exact names.'
