    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '<color=#E69529><b>LAYER 2 PLAN</b></color>


    Create on both switches:

    Management:
    VLAN 80

    Reception: VLAN 310

    Data: VLAN 20

    Native: VLAN 190 (native)

    Dead_Vlan:
    VLAN 888 (unused ports)


    ACCESS PORTS

    AN-1 Fa0/2 IT1; Fa0/3 Reception1;
    Fa0/4 Reception2; Fa0/5 IT2

    AN-2 Fa0/2 Data1; Fa0/3 Data2; Fa0/4 Data3


    802.1Q
    TRUNKS

    AN-1 Fa0/1 to AN-2 Fa0/1; AN-1 Fa0/6 to CN-1 Fa0/0

    Set dot1q,
    trunk mode, native VLAN, and allow Management, Reception, and Data.'
