    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '<color=#E69529><b>ADDRESSING AND GATEWAYS</b></color>


    MANAGEMENT
    / VLAN 80

    Network 192.168.100.0/24 | gateway 192.168.100.1

    RECEPTION
    / VLAN 310

    Network 192.168.12.0/24 | gateway 192.168.12.1

    DATA / VLAN
    20

    Network 192.168.65.0/24 | gateway 192.168.65.1


    ENDPOINT ADDRESSES

    IT1
    192.168.100.11  IT2 192.168.100.12

    Reception1 192.168.12.21  Reception2
    192.168.12.22

    Data1 192.168.65.31  Data2 192.168.65.32  Data3 192.168.65.33

    AP-1
    192.168.12.50 | TestLaptop 192.168.12.60 (DHCP)


    CN-1: Fa0/0.<VLAN> subinterfaces
    use dot1q and the matching gateway above.'
