  m_Text: '<color=#E69529><b>CARRIER CIRCUIT LETTER</b></color>


    CIRCUIT ID

    CIR-291738


    CUSTOMER
    / CN-1 Fa0/1

    Address 10.42.17.1 /30

    Provider next hop 10.42.17.2


    PHYSICAL
    HANDOFF

    Patch CN-1 Fa0/1 to Rack01 Patch1 Port18. The carrier side is landed
    at the DEMARC.


    ROUTING

    Configure a default route to 10.42.17.2. Verify
    with show ip route and an endpoint ping.'
