  m_Text: '<color=#E69529><b>GUEST WIRELESS</b></color>


    AP-1 MANAGEMENT

    Address
    192.168.12.50 on the Reception network.


    GUEST WI-FI

    SSID TSS-GUEST-677

    Passphrase
    [REDACTED_SECRET]

    Channel 6; disable WPS and apply the secured settings.


    UPLINK

    AP-1
    to Reception Wall Port05, then Rack01 Patch1 Port17 to AN-1 Fa0/7 in the Reception
    VLAN.


    TEST LAPTOP

    Join the guest SSID, use DHCP, then verify 192.168.12.60,
    provider reachability, and the RedWolf page.'
