    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '<color=#E69529><b>CABLE SCHEDULE</b></color>


    SWITCH AND ROUTER LINKS

    AN-1
    Fa0/1 to AN-2 Fa0/1: crossover

    CN-1 Fa0/0 to AN-1 Fa0/6: straight-through


    GROUND
    FLOOR

    IT1 to AN-1 Fa0/2; IT2 to AN-1 Fa0/5

    Reception1/2 to wall ports
    1/2, then Patch1 ports 1/2 to AN-1 Fa0/3/4.


    SECOND FLOOR

    Data1/2/3
    to Office wall ports, then Patch2 ports 1/5/6 to AN-2 Fa0/2/3/4.


    CIRCUIT
    AND WIRELESS

    CN-1 Fa0/1 to Patch1 Port18; AP-1 to Reception Wall Port05,
    then Patch1 Port17 to AN-1 Fa0/7.

    Complete each punch-down and patch cord
    in the structured path.'
